
<div class="flex flex-col gap-10 items-center pt-40">
  <h1 class="text-5xl">About Cathan’s CodeQuest</h1>
  <h3 class="text-xl">Designing and Building Ruby on Rails Applications</h3>

  <%# Main Content %>
  <div class="w-3/5 items-left mb-20">

    <figure class="w-full h-140">
      <%= image_tag( "about_001.png", class: "w-full h-full object-cover object-[40%_50%]") %>
    </figure>

    <div class="px-28 my-10">
      <h2 class="fond-bold text-2xl">Welcome to Cathan’s CodeQuest</h2>
      <div class="my-10 opacity-70">
        <p>
          a personal journey through software development, problem-solving, and continuous learning, with a particular focus on Ruby on Rails.
          This blog was created as a space to document what I’m learning, share practical tutorials, and explore ideas that come up while building
          real applications. As someone still growing as a developer, I believe that explaining concepts clearly, even (and especially) when you’re
          still learning them, is one of the best ways to truly understand them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <hr class="opacity-70">
    </div>

    <div class="px-28 my-10">
      <h2 class="fond-bold text-2xl">What You’ll Find Here</h2>
      <div class="my-10 opacity-70">
        <p>On Cathan’s CodeQuest, you can expect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-10">
          <li>Ruby on Rails tutorials focused on real-world use cases</li>
          <li> Step-by-step walkthroughs of implementation details and core concepts</li>
          <li>Insights and lessons learned from debugging, building, and experimenting</li>
          <li>Occasional reflections on tools, workflows, and best practices</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The content emphasizes clarity, fundamentals, and practical application, whether you are reinforcing core concepts or evaluating how problems are approached.
</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="w-full h-140">
      <%= image_tag("about_002.png", class:"w-full h-full object-cover")%>
    </figure>

     <div class="px-28 my-10">
      <h2 class="fond-bold text-2xl">Why I Started This Blog</h2>
      <div class="my-10 opacity-70">
        <p> I started this blog to document how I build software and to make my development process transparent. </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-10">
          <li>To sharpen clarity - writing forces clarity, and clarity builds confidence.</li>
          <li>To help others - if something I struggled with can save someone else time or frustration, it’s worth sharing.</li>
        </ol>
        <p> This is not a blog about having all the answers. It’s about asking better questions, documenting progress, and improving one step at a time.</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="opacity-50">
    </div>

     <div class="px-28 my-10">
      <h2 class="fond-bold text-2xl">Who This Blog Is For</h2>
      <div class="my-10 opacity-70">
        <p> This blog is for: </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-10">
          <li>Beginners learning Ruby, Rails, or web development</li>
          <li>Developers who enjoy practical, no-nonsense explanations</li>
          <li>Anyone curious about the learning process behind building software</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <hr class="opacity-50">
    </div>

     <div class="px-28 my-10">
      <h2 class="fond-bold text-2xl">Join the Quest</h2>
      <p class="my-10 opacity-70">
        If you’re learning, building, or simply curious, you’re welcome here. Feel free to explore, experiment with the code, and learn alongside me.
        Thanks for being part of the journey.
      </p>

      <p>— Cathan</p>

    </div>
  </div>

  <%# Footer %>
  <div class="w-full border-t border-b px-20 py-10 flex justify-between items-center">
    <a href="https://pkeane93.github.io/portfolio_page/" target= "_blank">
      <div class="flex gap-5 items-center ">

        <figure class="h-13 w-13 rounded-full overflow-hidden hover:scale-110">
          <%= image_tag("PkeBaliAvatar.jpg", class:"object-cover h-full w-full ") %>
        </figure>

        <div>
          <p class="font-bold">Pierre K.</p>
          <p class="opacity-70">Full Stack Software Engineer</p>
        </div>


      </div>
    </a>


    <div class="flex gap-10 items-center">
      <p class="text-xl font-semibold">Share this blog</p>

      <%= link_to("https://twitter.com",
            class: "border opacity-70 rounded-full p-4 hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out",
            target: "_blank") do %>

        <i class="text-4xl ti ti-brand-x"></i>
      <% end %>

       <%= link_to("https://facebook.com",
            class: "border opacity-70 rounded-full p-4 hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out",
            target: "_blank") do %>

        <i class="text-4xl ti ti-brand-facebook"></i>
      <% end %>

       <%= link_to("https://linkedin.com",
            class: "border opacity-70 rounded-full p-4 hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out",
            target: "_blank") do %>

        <i class="text-4xl ti ti-brand-linkedin"></i>
      <% end %>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>
